1530
00:52:42,360 --> 00:52:44,140
de

1531
00:52:44,140 --> 00:52:46,020
engemet a sport,

1532
00:52:46,620 --> 00:52:47,040
hát

1533
00:52:47,040 --> 00:52:50,020
