1539
00:53:00,380 --> 00:53:00,980
Kizárt.

1540
00:53:01,320 --> 00:53:02,120
Nincs az az idő.

1541
00:53:02,120 --> 00:53:05,640
Krisz,

1542
00:53:06,000 --> 00:53:08,620
